EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I wish I could swim like a fish.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Then everyone would think I was a
mermaid, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ojalá tuviera cola de pez.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Sería la sirena más mona de todo
el océano, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Magari nuotassi come un pesce!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Penserebbero tutti che sono
una sirena, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Keşke balık gibi yüzebilsem.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
O zaman herkes beni denizkızı sanardı,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
Ser un pez suena chupi, pero no
podría vestirme con ropa cuca.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Una vida sin moda no es vida!
